n't appeared, the condition for starting the music (mutual agreement) would not have been met.\n\n5.  **Conclusion:** Since the music started immediately following the interaction that included the female speaker's confirmation, her non-appearance would logically mean the music would not have started at that point.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
